{"unit_id":"ailiasdesu__dsh-session-manager#card-01","repo":"ailiasdesu/dsh-session-manager","commit":"0baf952ddeae941549a6add10ebd3e4b131c572a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Manager（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在 DSH 设置面板提供会话管理界面，帮助用户在不同工作区之间迁移会话，并管理已归档会话。它通过本地宿主路由读取工作区与会话列表，支持拖拽或点击选择目标工作区；迁移时更新会话日志归属，并同步工作区索引。用户还可以归档会话、恢复已归档会话或彻底删除已归档会话，迁移和删除前会备份相关文件。对仍打开的会话提供热迁移或重启后处理，并定期归档闲置子代理。适合需要整理多个工作区会话的 DSH Web 用户。需要 DSH Web 宿主和 Node.js 22.19 或更新版本，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:210-240","lib/client.js:428-466","lib/migrate.js:194-253","lib/workspace-files.js:63-108"]}
{"unit_id":"ailiasdesu__dsh-session-manager#card-02","repo":"ailiasdesu/dsh-session-manager","commit":"0baf952ddeae941549a6add10ebd3e4b131c572a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Session Manager helps DSH Web users organize sessions across workspaces. Users can move, archive, restore, and delete archived sessions. Migration backs up files and updates workspace indexes; open sessions may be queued for restart. Requires DSH Web and Node.js 22.19 or later.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:210-240","lib/client.js:428-466","lib/migrate.js:194-253","lib/workspace-files.js:63-108"]}
